flowchart LR
    User["userspace attach request<br/><b>does:</b> passes one BPF prog plus many function names/patterns<br/><b>why next:</b> kernel must resolve names before probes exist<br/><b>state:</b> desired attach set"]
    LinkCreate["BPF_LINK_CREATE<br/><b>does:</b> creates kprobe_multi link request<br/><b>why next:</b> link gives one lifetime owner for all probes<br/><b>state:</b> pending bpf_link fd"]
    Resolve["name/address resolution<br/><b>does:</b> resolves kallsyms/ftrace locations and sorts addresses<br/><b>why next:</b> ftrace needs concrete instruction sites<br/><b>state:</b> validated address array"]
    Install["install probes<br/><b>does:</b> attaches ftrace-based probe at each resolved function<br/><b>why next:</b> runtime calls need a dispatch target<br/><b>state:</b> many sites owned by one link"]
    Runtime["matched function fires<br/><b>does:</b> same BPF program runs and can call bpf_get_func_ip<br/><b>why next:</b> program uses IP to distinguish which function fired<br/><b>state:</b> per-call ctx plus function identity"]
    Close["close bpf_link<br/><b>does:</b> removes every installed probe atomically as link lifetime ends<br/><b>state:</b> no stray per-function attachments"]

    User --> LinkCreate --> Resolve --> Install --> Runtime --> Close

    classDef us fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef kern fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef run fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class User,LinkCreate us
    class Resolve,Install kern
    class Runtime,Close run
